          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Congruent vs Incongruent RT breakdown -->
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800/40 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700/60 mb-5 flex items-center justify-around text-xs font-mono">
          <div>
            <span class="text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 block text-[10px] uppercase">Конгруэнтный RT</span>
            <span id="modal-congruent-rt" class="font-bold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 text-sm">0ms</span>
          </div>
          <div class="h-6 w-px bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-700"></div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 block text-[10px] uppercase">Неконгруэнтный RT</span>
            <span id="modal-incongruent-rt" class="font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 text-sm">0ms</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="modal-best-alert" class="hidden mb-5 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 text-xs font-semibold">
          New Personal Best Record!
        </div>

        <!-- Scientific Attribution Card -->
        <div class="text-left p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800/40 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700/60 mb-3.5 text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          <span class="font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white block mb-1 font-heading">Научная основа:</span>
          Based on the classic Stroop Effect paradigm (Stroop, 1935). Measures selective attention, cognitive flexibility, и executive inhibition of automatic reading responses.
        </div>

        <!-- Scoring Formula Breakdown Card -->
        <div class="text-left p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800/40 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700/60 mb-3.5 text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed font-mono">
          <span class="font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white block mb-1 font-sans">Подсчёт очков:</span>
          Score = (Accuracy * 50) + Speed Factor (up to 40 pts for RT &lt; 600ms) + Interference Control Bonus (up to 10 pts for low conflict latency)
        </div>

        <!-- Практика Effects Disclaimer -->
        <div class="text-left p-3 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-100/70 dark:bg-zinc-800/30 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 mb-6 text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-normal italic">
          Performance scores reflect task-specific operational fluency и response speed under practice effects, not innate general intelligence (g). Repeated drills refine cognitive agility.
        </div>

        <!-- Modal Actions -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <button
            id="btn-modal-restart"
            type="button"
            class="flex-1 min-h-[44px] py-3 rounded-xl bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-[1.01] active:scale-[0.99] cursor-pointer"
          >
            Play Again
          </button>
          <a
            href="/ru/games"
            class="px-5 min-h-[44px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-zinc-100 hover:bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-200 font-semibold text-sm transition-colors"
          >
            Hub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Educational Guide & Cognitive Science Section (Crawler Visible) -->
    <section class="mt-14 pt-10 border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-8">
      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider pastel-tag pastel-tag-coral mb-2">
          CHC Broad Ability: Processing Speed (Gs) &amp; Executive Inhibition (Gf)
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white mb-3">
          The Stroop Effect: Cognitive Conflict &amp; Selective Attention
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          The Stroop task is a classic psychological paradigm demonstrating the interference that occurs when processing conflicting visual cues. Because word reading is an overlearned, automatic process for literate adults, naming the font color of an incongruent word (e.g. the word "BLUE" printed in red ink) requires deliberate executive suppression of the prepotent reading pathway.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
