          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Words will appear in red, blue, green, or yellow ink. Your objective is to indicate the <strong>font color</strong> as fast as possible, completely ignoring what the word spells. Клавиши <strong>[1-4]</strong> or tap the matching color buttons.
          </p>
