          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Scoring combines overall decision accuracy with reaction speed (sub-600ms latency bonuses). Your interference cost is measured as the millisecond delay between congruent и incongruent trials.
