          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            First published by John Ridley Stroop in 1935 (<em>Journal of Experimental Psychology</em>), the Stroop paradigm is a cornerstone of neuropsychological batteries for assessing frontal lobe executive functioning.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Psychometric Disclaimer Callout -->
      <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/30 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/60 text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-300 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Important Psychometric Note:</strong> Stroop Clash evaluates reaction speed, perceptual conflict resolution, и selective attention under practice conditions. It does not measure general intelligence (<em>g</em>) or replace a comprehensive psychometric assessment.
      </div>

      <!-- Cross Links -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">
            Assess Your Full Cognitive Profile
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">
            Test your Fluid Reasoning, Visual-Spatial, Quantitative, и Verbal abilities with our free 24-item test.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
          <a href="/ru/quick-test" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 hover:bg-zinc-300 transition-colors">Экспресс 10м Test</a>
          <a href="/ru/test" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white transition-colors shadow-xs">Full 20m Exam</a>
